        evl_gen_9: 'Ninth Generation',
        evl_handhelds_title: 'Handheld consoles',
        evl_handhelds_nintendo: 'Nintendo Handhelds',
        evl_handhelds_sony: 'Sony Handhelds',
        evl_handhelds_other: 'Other Handheld Consoles',
        evl_tl_2600_sub: 'Home-console era \u2014 first experiences',
        evl_tl_2600_note: 'The first console with a programmable CPU and interchangeable cartridges. This is where home gaming began.',
        evl_tl_nes_sub: 'Industry saved after the 1983 crash',
        evl_tl_nes_note: 'The NES restored trust in consoles. GamePak and strict quality control over games were key.',
        evl_tl_snes_sub: '16-bit era \u2014 memorable color and soundtracks',
        evl_tl_snes_note: 'Mode 7 for rotation and scaling. Superior audio with the Sony SPC700 chip. The era of Super Mario World and Chrono Trigger.',
        evl_tl_ps1_sub: 'Transition to real-time 3D \u2014 changing the rules',
        evl_tl_ps1_note: 'The first major full-3D console. CD-ROM enabled larger games and FMV. Final Fantasy VII, Metal Gear Solid.',
        evl_tl_ps2_sub: 'Absolute dominance \u2014 the best-selling console in history',
        evl_tl_ps2_note: 'The most successful gaming system. Built-in DVD player. GTA, God of War, Shadow of the Colossus.',
        evl_tl_360_sub: 'The start of HD era and mainstream online gaming',
        evl_tl_360_note: 'The first successful HD console. Xbox Live revolutionized online gaming. Halo 3, Gears of War, Mass Effect.',
        evl_tl_ps3_sub: 'Blu-ray, HDD and HD gaming \u2014 multimedia powerhouse',
        evl_tl_ps3_note: 'Ambitious Cell architecture. The first affordable Blu-ray player. The Last of Us, Uncharted, Metal Gear Solid 4.',
        evl_tl_ps4_sub: 'Modern era \u2014 digital, streaming, and social gaming',
        evl_tl_ps4_note: 'x86 architecture for easier development. PS4 Pro / Xbox One X brought 4K gaming. God of War, Spider-Man, Horizon.',
        evl_tl_ps5_sub: 'Ray tracing hardware and fast SSDs',
        evl_tl_ps5_note: 'The ray tracing generation and near-zero loading times. 120 FPS, 3D audio, haptic feedback.',

